{"unit_id":"Yummyxl__dsh-eyecare#card-zh","repo":"Yummyxl/dsh-eyecare","commit":"efeb92e1bcfe54369f88b6e8a176ad87f87a17b0","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-eyecare 是一款面向 DSH Web 的护眼主题插件。它在设置的常规项目中加入护眼模式开关，并通过主题 token 覆盖层调整界面配色。开启后可在浅色和深色主题上应用柔和的豆沙绿配色，关闭时移除覆盖层；开关状态保存在浏览器中，刷新后可恢复。适合希望在 DSH Web 中切换低饱和绿色界面的用户。无需 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:15-20","lib/client.js:164-213","lib/client.js:239-286"]}
{"unit_id":"Yummyxl__dsh-eyecare#card-en","repo":"Yummyxl/dsh-eyecare","commit":"efeb92e1bcfe54369f88b6e8a176ad87f87a17b0","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-eyecare adds a green eye-care switch to DSH Web settings. It applies a light and dark theme token palette, removes it when switched off, and restores the browser-saved preference on reload. No API key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:15-20","lib/client.js:164-213","lib/client.js:239-286"]}
